---
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="photo-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/about.jpg"
          alt="Bobby Pehtrus"
          width="623"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="kicker">About</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Engineer by trade, health-tech by direction.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            I'm Bobby — an experienced iOS developer with a track record of
            improving both developer experience and user experience, promoting
            app quality and visibility through tooling and automation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Across Traveloka and GetGo, I shipped consumer products at scale —
            core mobile infrastructure, SwiftUI modernization, vehicle
            telematics, and cloud observability. That grounding in dependable,
            mass-market software is what I bring to health: patients can't wait
            for systems that crash.
          </p>
          <p>
            Now a Master's student at NTU in Smart Medicine &amp; Health
            Informatics, I'm applying AI to clinical and public-health problems —
            on-device triage, population monitoring, edge AI that works even
            offline, even in a crisis.
          </p>
          <p class="sig">
            Off the clock? I love to travel, and I would gladly walk a long way
            for a good coffee.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) 7fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .photo-wrap {
    max-width: 300px;
    align-self: start;
  }

  .photo-wrap img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 4px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .sig {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .photo-wrap {
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>